@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam titleFontSize 21
skinparam ArrowColor #42566B
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 65
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  BorderColor #42566B
  FontColor #172B4D
  StartColor #253E55
  EndColor #253E55
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
title Parking Reservation - State-Chart Diagram

state "Confirmed" as Confirmed
Confirmed : Entire parking interval reserved
Confirmed : Vehicle has not checked in
state "Checked In" as CheckedIn
CheckedIn : Linked parking session is Active
CheckedIn : Actual arrival recorded without rounding
state "Completed" as Completed
Completed : Linked parking session is Closed
Completed : Actual departure recorded without rounding
state "Cancelled" as Cancelled
Cancelled : Parking and eligible dependent requests cancelled
Cancelled : Remaining allocations released once
state "Expired" as Expired
Expired : No-show; check-in and cancellation disabled
Expired : Unused charging requests cancelled; holds released once

[*] --> Confirmed : / create reservation, snapshot expiresAt and allocate ALL covered slots
note top of Confirmed
  Only successfully created reservations enter this lifecycle.
end note

Confirmed -down-> CheckedIn : checkInConfirmed (UC-P06)\n[authorized owner && matching Hub/vehicle\n&& arrival <= now < expiresAt && allocation can be honoured]\n/ create one Active session; account occupancy against existing holds
Confirmed -left-> Cancelled : cancellationConfirmed (UC-P04)\n[authorized owner && cancellation permitted\n&& now < expiresAt && dependents cancellable && summary still current]\n/ cancel reservation and Pending/Scheduled dependents; release holds once
Confirmed -right-> Expired : expiryCheck (FR-NI-13)\n[now >= expiresAt && no Active parking/charging session]\n/ expire as NoShow; cancel unused charging; release remaining holds once

CheckedIn -down-> Completed : departureConfirmed (UC-P07)\n[authorized owner && latest states verified\n&& no Active charging && summary still current]\n/ close visit; cancel unused requests; release remaining allocations once
note left of CheckedIn
  Cancelling checkout does not restart stopped charging.
end note
note right of Expired
  expiresAt = min(arrival + grace, departure).
  Default grace: 15 minutes; snapshot per reservation.
end note
note right of Completed
  Early checkout also releases unused reserved time.
end note

Cancelled --> [*]
Completed --> [*]
Expired --> [*]

footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
